== ψ-Dependent Extensions ==

=== Soliton Amplification ===

The <math>\lambda\psi^3</math> term also supports soliton propagation — self-stabilising ψ amplitude envelopes that resist decay. In the amplifier context, a soliton entering the gain medium experiences gain exactly compensating its natural spreading tendency (due to dispersion) and loss (due to tan δ_ψ). This produces a soliton amplifier with zero net dispersion and gain exactly equal to loss — a self-sustaining coherent ψ state that persists indefinitely given continuous pump.

This is the physical basis for the [[Psi Stabilizer]] Anchor mode soliton — not a parametric amplifier but a soliton self-stabilisation regime where nonlinear gain balances linear loss.

